and a senator's vacation home). But what if curing disease was more profitable than treating it?

194
00:20:49,340 --> 00:20:53,400
What if peace paid better than war? That's what a one percent treaty does.

195
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:57,500
It doesn't fight the corruption machine. It feeds it different inputs.

196
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:04,520
You're going to out-bribe the bribers with math. P.S. - If this chapter depressed you, good.

